PDO_SQLITE: the SQLite 3 driver of PDO, with SQLite of the package az.

The module pdo_sqlite of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/pdo_sqlite.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/pdo_sqlite.
